From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement _cgets_s, _cgetws, _cgetws_s and the ucrtbase console scanf.

Console line input that was spec stubs: _cgetws (the wide _cgets, msvcr70
and later), _cgets_s and _cgetws_s (a line of at most size - 1 characters
without its end, the length through the count pointer; msvcr80 and later,
ucrtbase), and ucrtbase's __conio_common_vcscanf and
__conio_common_vcwscanf (the console scanf behind _cscanf and _cwscanf).
